The {{Term/Store|Well-Worn Trousers|Well-Worn Trousers|Series, BotW}} are an [[Item]] in {{BotW}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

==Location and Uses==
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Well-Worn Trousers are a heavily-worn piece of [[Armor]] that were made long before [[Link]]'s awakening from the [[Slumber of Restoration]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Due to their weathered condition and short legs, they appear to not have been made for Link at his age.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> The Well-Worn Trousers provide no additional benefits from wearing them other than marginally boosting Link's defense. They can be obtained either from a stone [[Treasure Chest]] inside the [[Shrine of Resurrection]] or from [[Granté]] in [[Tarrey Town]] after the "[[From the Ground Up]]" [[Side Quest]] is completed.

